        "text": "grok @bot 0.70.2 is rolling out!\n\n- each bot can claim its own email address at @mail.grokbot.com and draft emails for you to send\n- apps like Figma, Notion and Canva show up as live cards right in the chat\n- bots can search X and read public posts and profiles without connecting an X account\n- describe what you want and your bot suggests a matching template\n- shared pages can be downloaded as a pdf\n- an approval check before anything irreversible\n\nand much more!\n\nhttps://x.ai/changelog/bot",
